  "description": "JAFCEC crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group C 2/c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C72 H56 Dy4 N12 O16,4(C1 H4 O1). From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy1A (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy2A (Dy) has 6 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 4 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.948-3.963 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 109.22-114.79°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Dy4(HL)4(CH3O)4]·4CH3OH (C76H72Dy4N12O20).",
